# Local open-weight model for the development screen (2026-11-06).
# Base: qwen2.5:7b-instruct from the Ollama library (Q4_K_M, Apache 2.0); digest recorded in the run folder.
# Only change: a 16k context window, so that no dossier (longest first-call prompt about 5,500 Chinese
# characters) or review call is cut off. Ollama's default window is shorter and truncates silently.
FROM qwen2.5:7b-instruct
PARAMETER num_ctx 16384
